    "number": 118,
    "summary": "1–3, The Lord will provide for the families of the Twelve; 4–6, Vacancies in the Twelve are filled.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given through Joseph Smith the Prophet, at Far West, Missouri, July 8, 1838, in response to the supplication, “Show us thy will, O Lord, concerning the Twelve.”"
      }
    ],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Verily, thus saith the Lord: Let a conference be held immediately; let the Twelve be organized; and let men be appointed to supply the place of those who are fallen.",
        "footNotes": [
